==Description==
'''Aquaman''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It is obtained from Level 29 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{BeachBalls|980}} or {{Robux|70}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,261}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|88}} with a total cost of {{Robux|2,842}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|2,240}}.

==Appearance==
'''Aquaman''' sticker shows the {{Color|Surf|Aqua}} [[Commander]] with the [[w:c:roblox:Catalog:Man_Face|Man Face]]. A boom sound effect can be heard when used.

==Trivia==
*'''Aquaman's''' description references the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/we-are-not-the-same We Are Not the Same] meme, a catchphrase popularized on X in the fall of 2019.
**The meme is often depicted with the character [[w:c:breakingbad:Gustavo Fring|Gustavo Fring]] from ''Breaking Bad''.

